  "name": "Boss Notifier",
  "slug": "boss-notifier",
  "teaser": "Notifies you of which bosses you'll face in your upcoming raid!",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1737.png",
  "downloads": 224890,
  "favourites_count": 4,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Basics</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Turns your ordinary intelligence center into a boss detector!</p>\n<p>Default <strong>hotkey to show notifications is ‘O’</strong></p>\n<p>Various details are unlocked by the level of your intel center.</p>\n<p>Boss Notification Details:</p>\n<p>- Base information includes whether or not a boss will be in your raid.</p>\n<p>- Location detail will notify you of the bosses spawn zone (where on the map they’re gonna spawn)</p>\n<p>- Detection checkmark notifies you of which bosses have already spawned in your raid (Look for a checkmark next to the notification)</p>\n<p>Boss Detection Feature:</p>\n<p>- Notifies you when a boss has been detected in your vicinity.</p>\n<p>Key differences between regular boss notifications and boss detections:</p>\n<p>The boss notifications only show information about what bosses will spawn <strong>*in the future*</strong></p>\n<p><strong>The detection notification happens when a boss is actually spawn into the game, meaning they’re somewhere on the map with you. My aim for this feature was to add some certainty to whether or not a boss is actually spawned in and active.</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Simply extract BossNotifier.zip into your SPT game folder.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Config</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Hit F12 in game to open your config settings.</p>\n<p>1. What intel center level you will unlock the functionality of this mod. If this is greater than your intel center level then you will not receive notifications.</p>\n<p>2. What intel center level you need in order to receive location data on the bosses present in your raid.</p>\n<p>3. What intel center level you need in order to receive notifications when a boss spawns near you.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>If you see anything that stands out to you, please let me know in the comments and I’ll work on it as soon as I can!</p>\n<p>- <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/878-swag-donuts-dynamic-spawn-waves-and-custom-spawn-points/#comments/comment47945\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/878-swag-donuts-dynamic-spawn-waves-and-custom-spawn-points/#comments/comment47945</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support My Work</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Never feel obligated to donate for support.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
